      "value": "You absorb the knowledge contained in a piece of writing up to the size of a book. A short touch will teach you the gist of it, whereas a few minutes of concentration are enough to gain an understanding of its contents. A full day is required if you want to achieve a word-by-word memorization. You don’t need to know the language of the writing. This spell can also decipher non-magical code."
